{"url":"http://www.unibz.it/en/applicants/international/international-degree-seeking-applicants","status":200,"fetched_at":"2026-11-16","title":"International degree-seeking Applicants / Free University of Bozen-Bolzano","blocks":["International students","Trilingual bachelor programmes","The student halls at the Bozen-Bolzano and Brixen-Bressanone campuses host 700 students. The price for a single bedroom is €360 and €270 for a double room. You can usually apply online for an accommodation from mid-June until the beginning of July.","Students under 26 can buy the südtirolmobil U26 Pass valid for a year for €150. This ticket is managed by the local government (Autonomous Province of Bozen-Bolzano). It can be used on all public transport in South Tyrol and on regional trains to Trento.","Living costs in South Tyrol are comparable to those of many other cities in Northern Italy. Approximately, if you exclude tuition fees, you will need at least €800 per month for living (accommodation, food, study materials, leisure, clothing) in the Bozen-Bolzano area.","Bachelor Days and Online Info Sessions"],"links":[{"url":"http://www.unibz.it/en/applicants/international/international-degree-seeking-applicants","text":"Skip to content"},{"url":"http://www.unibz.it/en/applicants/international/international-degree-seeking-applicants","text":""},{"url":"http://www.unibz.it/en/study-programmes","text":"Study Programmes"},{"url":"http://www.unibz.it/en/faculties/agricultural-environmental-food-sciences/bachelor-food-enogastronomy-sciences","text":"Bachelor"},{"url":"http://www.unibz.it/en/faculties/agricultural-environmental-food-sciences/bachelor-food-enogastronomy-sciences","text":"AGR Food and Enogastronomy Sciences"},{"url":"http://www.unibz.it/en/faculties/agricultural-environmental-food-sciences/bachelor-sustainable-agriculture-forestry-mountain-environments","text":"AGR Sustainable Agriculture and Forestry in Mountain Environments"},{"url":"http://www.unibz.it/en/faculties/desi